From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:33:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: Add PM clock definitions for Kaanapali

The CPAS AHB and AXI clocks are shared by every Kaanapali TFE and IFE
sub-block. Register them as PM clocks so the PM clock framework enables
them once when CAMSS resumes, instead of each sub-block listing them and
taking its own reference.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261112-kaanapali-camss-v25-7-1d709f57f370@oss.qualcomm.com
Reviewed-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
index b5a912ef5a5a0905f97b0877e195221b3d448b4e..a498e4a8145c8bc25480c25a6f16b6a71e13e94a 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c
@@ -5654,6 +5654,7 @@ static void camss_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)
 static const struct camss_resources kaanapali_resources = {
 	.version = CAMSS_KAANAPALI,
 	.pd_name = "top",
+	.pm_clks = { "cpas_fast_ahb", "cpas_ahb", "gcc_axi_hf" },
 	.icc_res = icc_res_kaanapali,
 	.tpg_res = tpg_res_8775p,
 	.icc_path_num = ARRAY_SIZE(icc_res_kaanapali),
